56,2,4,talk,Rin,,"I agree! I'm ready to see the options. Let's make sure the plan is actually fair for everyone and not just a ""secret"" way to keep the bins in one spot!

Rin:","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
