65,3,1,talk,Kenji,,"Option A seems like it would cause too much stress with the paperwork, and Option C makes someone the ""boss"" of the bags. I think Option B is the friendliest way to share the burden!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"I agree with Kenji. Option A sounds like it might lead to that sour smell we discussed, and Option C could make our neighbors feel uneasy. Rotating seems like a very gentle way to be fair.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,1,talk,Asuka,,Option A is out due to the filing requirements and frontage constraints. Option C is unacceptable; supervising for an hour is a significant time burden that will inevitably fall on one person. I vote for Option B.,"{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,1,talk,Rin,,"Option A is just a stinky box in one spot, and Option C is super boring and takes too long! Option B is the only one where everyone actually takes a turn!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,1,talk,Servas,,"Option A presents a financial burden that may be too heavy for some, and Option C asks for a sacrifice of time that is not easily returned. Option B is a path of shared experience and balance.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Asuka, @Rin, @Shizue, @Servas, it's awesome that we all agree! If we rotate, no one feels singled out, and we can all help each other move the bins. It's the best way to stay friends!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Rin"",""Shizue"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"It is such a relief to see us all in agreement. When we share the small burdens together, they become much lighter, and our hearts stay light too. I feel very peaceful about this.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"While I agree that rotation is the most logical choice, we must be mindful of the narrow frontages I mentioned. We will need a clear, simple schedule to ensure the transition is seamless and doesn't create new work.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,2,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, we can just figure out the narrow spots together! As long as the bins don't stay at one person's gate forever, I'm happy. It's way better than being a bin-boss for an hour!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,2,talk,Servas,,"@Asuka, your wisdom regarding the narrow spaces is noted. If we approach these challenges with patience and a helping hand, we can easily adapt the rotation to fit each home's unique shape.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,3,talk,Kenji,,I'm so happy we're all on the same page! Let's just make sure the rotation is easy so nobody gets stressed. I'm definitely voting for Option B!,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,3,talk,Shizue,,"I agree completely. As long as we support each other and keep our communication warm and open, Option B will be a wonderful choice for our neighborhood. I will vote for B.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,3,talk,Asuka,,"Since we have reached a consensus that avoids both the bureaucratic nightmare of Option A and the unsustainable labor of Option C, I am satisfied. I vote for Option B.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,3,talk,Rin,,I'm voting for B too! It's the only way to make sure it's actually fair and that nobody is stuck with the stinky bins all by themselves!,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,3,talk,Servas,,"It is a joy to see such unity. Option B protects our finances and our friendships, ensuring no one is burdened beyond their capacity. I, too, cast my vote for Option B.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
80,3,4,talk,Kenji,,Yay! I'm so glad we could all agree on this. It's going to make our lane such a happy place to live! I'm voting for B!,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
